# 2. PRODUCT SCOPE

## 2.1 MVP Features

The Minimum Viable Product (MVP) must include:

- Landing page.
- Mystery creation form.
- AI-generated mystery case.
- AI-generated suspect profiles.
- AI-generated investigation evidence.
- Investigation dashboard.
- Evidence viewer.
- Suspect selection.
- Final accusation.
- Case resolution and explanation.
- User's case history.
- Restart or create another mystery.

## 2.2 Features Outside the Initial MVP

The following features are not mandatory for the first version:

- Multiplayer investigations.
- Real-time cooperative detective gameplay.
- User-generated public case sharing.
- Leaderboards.
- Competitive detective rankings.
- Voice-based interrogation.
- Live AI-generated video footage.
- Real-world criminal investigation.
- Paid subscriptions.
- Mobile applications.
- User-created custom evidence uploads.

These may be introduced in later versions.

## 2.3 Important Product Rule

All cases generated by the website must be fictional.

The application must not present generated investigations as real criminal cases or real-world evidence.

